<title>CHINA: China oil product imports soar 56 pct in Jan-July.</title>
<headline>China oil product imports soar 56 pct in Jan-July.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of oil products in the first seven months soared by 56 percent to 13.45 million tonnes, customs figures issued on Friday show.</p>
<p>The figures gave no breakdown for the oil product imports.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (86) 10-6532-1921; Fax 10-6532-4978</p>
</text>
